### RX Clinic API: sample requests for the VSCode "REST Client" extension.
### Click "Send Request" above a request. Start the API first (server: npm run dev).
### Requests are chained: "login" stores the token that later requests use.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@password = Clinic2026!Pass

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

### Sign in as the doctor
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dr.reyes@rxclinic.local", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctor dashboard: today's visits, pending labs
GET {{base}}/doctors/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patients who have booked with me
# @name patients
GET {{base}}/patients?search=dela
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@patientId = {{patients.response.body.data[0].id}}

### Full chart (allergies, meds, conditions, notes, Rx, labs) — this access is audit-logged
GET {{base}}/patients/{{patientId}}/chart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Drug search
# @name drugs
GET {{base}}/drugs?q=amox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Safety dry-run: amoxicillin for a penicillin-allergic patient → contraindicated alert
POST {{base}}/prescriptions/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": "{{patientId}}", "drugIds": ["{{drugs.response.body[0].id}}"] }

### Signing it without an override reason → 409 with the alerts
POST {{base}}/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "items": [{ "drugId": "{{drugs.response.body[0].id}}", "dose": "1 capsule", "frequency": "three times daily", "durationDays": 7, "quantity": 21 }]
}

### Record a consultation note (notes are encrypted at rest)
POST {{base}}/encounters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Headache for 3 days",
  "notes": "BP elevated. Continue losartan. Recheck in 2 weeks.",
  "vitals": { "bp": "150/95", "hr": 82, "temp": 36.8 },
  "diagnoses": ["I10", "R51"]
}

### ─────────── Patient flow ───────────

### Sign in as a patient
# @name plogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "juan@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

@ptoken = {{plogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Doctors accepting bookings
# @name doctors
GET {{base}}/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{ptoken}}

### Open slots for a date (change the date to an upcoming Monday–Saturday)
# @name slots
GET {{base}}/doctors/{{doctors.response.body[0].id}}/slots?date=2026-10-05
Authorization: Bearer {{ptoken}}

### Book the first slot
POST {{base}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{ptoken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "doctorId": "{{doctors.response.body[0].id}}", "startsAt": "{{slots.response.body[0].start}}", "type": "telemedicine", "reason": "Follow-up" }

### My appointments
GET {{base}}/appointments?pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{ptoken}}

### Try to open someone else's data → 403 (RBAC)
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{ptoken}}

### ─────────── Front desk ───────────

# @name rlogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "reception@rxclinic.local", "password": "{{password}}" }

@rtoken = {{rlogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Senior citizen invoice: ₱1,100 → ₱880 (20% off, VAT-exempt)
# @name invoice
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{rtoken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "discountType": "senior",
  "items": [
    { "itemType": "consultation", "description": "Professional fee", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 600 },
    { "itemType": "lab", "description": "Fasting blood sugar", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 500 }
  ]
}

### Cash payment. Sending the same Idempotency-Key twice records it only once.
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{rtoken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-0001

{ "amount": 880, "method": "cash" }

### Low-stock items
GET {{base}}/inventory?lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{rtoken}}
